{
  "source": "Prompts/how-ai-answers-2.mp4",
  "duration": 209.7923125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.56,
      "text": "When you ask an AI a question, it first works out what your words mean together."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.24,
      "end": 6.66,
      "text": "But then it faces a new problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.28,
      "end": 9.06,
      "text": "How does it actually begin an answer?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.72,
      "end": 12.36,
      "text": "Let's give it a simple question to see how it builds a reply."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.16,
      "end": 14.48,
      "text": "What should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.24,
      "end": 18.96,
      "text": "To make this easier to follow, we will look at each word as a single token."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.6,
      "end": 25.32,
      "text": "Before the answer even begins, this diagram shows how the question goes through a set of preparation steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.32,
      "end": 29.42,
      "text": "First, the AI breaks the question into pieces, called tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.18,
      "end": 33.44,
      "text": "Then it marks exactly where each piece belongs in the sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.26,
      "end": 36.38,
      "text": "Next, it turns each token into numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.04,
      "end": 39.62,
      "text": "These starting vectors carry the initial meaning of the words."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.38,
      "end": 46.06,
      "text": "Finally, the tokens pass through multiple stacked layers, where attention and transformation work together"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.06,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "to update those numbers based on the surrounding context."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.76,
      "end": 53.16,
      "text": "With this preparation complete, the AI is ready to start responding."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.16,
      "end": 57.78,
      "text": "AI uses the final token's updated numbers to predict what comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.34,
      "end": 65.52,
      "text": "It might seem counterintuitive that out in a time sentence, the AI relies on the very last token to kick off its reply."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.28,
      "end": 69.16,
      "text": "Let's look at why that final token holds so much value."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.92,
      "end": 73.02,
      "text": "Looking at this graphic, the question sits in a row of tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.84,
      "end": 78.78,
      "text": "This final token, the question mark, gathered information from every single token before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.78,
      "end": 85.24,
      "text": "Its updated numbers now form its final vector, which the AI uses to predict the first token of its answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.02,
      "end": 88.54,
      "text": "Now the AI is ready to begin building its response."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.28,
      "end": 96.14,
      "text": "It uses those numbers from the final token to calculate a probability score for every potential next token in its entire vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.08,
      "end": 98.62,
      "text": "What follows is a repeating loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.3,
      "end": 105.62,
      "text": "The AI selects a token, adds it to the growing reply, and then uses that newly expanded context to predict again."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.62,
      "end": 110.72,
      "text": "In prediction one, the final token is the question mark, and the AI selects you."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.3,
      "end": 114.44,
      "text": "It repeats this process adding could, name, and him."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.22,
      "end": 118.02,
      "text": "By prediction five, the top predictions shift to dog names."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.88,
      "end": 122.34,
      "text": "The AI selects spot, completing the full sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.02,
      "end": 123.98,
      "text": "You could name him spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.86,
      "end": 130.28,
      "text": "You might be wondering why the AI started with you instead of just outputting a dog name immediately."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.28,
      "end": 136.76,
      "text": "The word you simply scored as a highly probable natural way to start a conversational reply."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.58,
      "end": 140.08,
      "text": "Each added token changes what can fit next."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.8,
      "end": 146.92,
      "text": "A specific dog name only becomes the most likely continuation after the conversational setup is established."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.7,
      "end": 153.14,
      "text": "AI keeps predicting tokens until it produces a special token that signals the answer is enished."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.98,
      "end": 159.52,
      "text": "This flowchart breaks down the formal steps of the loop we just observed using our dog name example."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.52,
      "end": 161.26,
      "text": "Step one is rank."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.98,
      "end": 165.1,
      "text": "The AI scores every possible next token in its vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.06,
      "end": 171.9,
      "text": "Here, spot scores 22%, max 17%, and buddy 14%."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.9,
      "end": 173.38,
      "text": "Step two is kick."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.06,
      "end": 176.42,
      "text": "The AI selects spot as its next token."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.08,
      "end": 178.12,
      "text": "Step three is add."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.72,
      "end": 183.84,
      "text": "The AI attaches that new token to the sequence, so the answer now reads, you could name him spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.5,
      "end": 186.1,
      "text": "Finally, step four is repeat."
    },
    {
      "start": 186.1,
      "end": 193.14,
      "text": "The system takes that longer context and uses it to predict what the following token should be."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.92,
      "end": 199.82,
      "text": "Inference is the process AI uses to generate an answer one token at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.58,
      "end": 203.54,
      "text": "Every answer is built one token at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 204.28,
      "end": 205.88,
      "text": "The whole run is called inference."
    }
  ],
